<section>
  <div class="wrap two">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Every morning</p>
      <h2>English, Maths and Science</h2>
      <p>The day starts with a soft arrival and homeroom, then three lessons before lunch. <strong>English</strong> is reading real books, writing things people will read, and talking. A lot of talking. <strong>Maths</strong> starts with objects and patterns and works up to the abstract. <strong>Science</strong> is experiments first, explanations second.</p>
      <p>The Cambridge Primary framework means your child's progress is measured against a standard schools recognise anywhere, and moving on later is straightforward.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="blob-wrap blob-wrap--green has-sticker">
      <span class="sticker sticker--green sticker--tr">Cambridge Primary</span>
      {% photo "gallery-reading-corner", "photo--lg photo--square photo--tilt-r" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set waveColor = "pale" %}{% include "partials/wave.njk" %}
<section class="band--pale">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="center narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--sun">Every afternoon</p>
      <h2>The classes with the odd names</h2>
      <p class="lede">These are the afternoon classes on this year's Primary timetable. They are where the English gets used.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cards cards--3 mt">
      <div class="card">{{ ic.icon("whisk", "sun") }}<h3>Cooking</h3><p>A real kitchen, real knives under supervision, and a dish to take home on Thursdays and Fridays.</p></div>
      <div class="card">{{ ic.icon("laptop", "blue") }}<h3>Technology</h3><p>Typing, coding, and making things on a screen that do what you told them to.</p></div>
      <div class="card">{{ ic.icon("palette", "coral") }}<h3>Craft and Art</h3><p>Lanterns, printing, clay, paint. Assessed by what gets made, not by a test.</p></div>
      <div class="card">{{ ic.icon("ball", "green") }}<h3>Movement and Exercise</h3><p>Structured sport, fitness and free play on the turf, twice a week.</p></div>
      <div class="card">{{ ic.icon("book", "violet") }}<h3>Everyday Experts, Master Minds, Book Worms</h3><p>Practical know-how, puzzles and reading, in small groups.</p></div>
      <div class="card">{{ ic.icon("clock", "sun") }}<h3>Boredom</h3><p>Yes, a class called Boredom. No screens, no instructions. It is where the best ideas come from. Ask us about it on your visit.</p></div>
