<section class="band--pale faq">
  <div class="wrap narrow">
    <h2>Questions parents ask</h2>
    <details><summary>My child's English is basic. Can they keep up?</summary><p>Yes. Your child does not need fluent English to join Primary, and children who arrive with little English usually settle in quickly. The whole day is in English, in a class of {{ site.classCap }} or fewer, so they hear and use it all day with a teacher close by.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Which year group will my child join?</summary><p>Usually the one that matches their age. Our academic team meets your child and reads their last school report, and may suggest a different class if it will suit them better.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Is there homework?</summary><p>Some. Teachers post work and updates on Google Classroom, and you get your own guardian account to follow along. There are also Boredom periods in the week, when students can read, finish work or follow a project of their own.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Do you offer transport or lunch?</summary><p>Both, and both are optional. Lunch and two snacks cost 80,000 VND a day, and the menu goes home every week. The bus covers Hội An, Vĩnh Điện and Đà Nẵng, from 2,000,000 VND a month depending on the route. Details are on the <a href="{{ '/admissions/tuition-and-fees/' | url }}">fees page</a>.</p></details>
  </div>
</section>

